test 'a build naming a runtime file with a leading dot segment compiles that file once, as the tiers'
	try expectALibraryFileBesideAProgramIsReadOnce("build-naming-a-dot-prefixed-runtime-file-beside-a-program-loads-it-once", libraryFile: "./runtime/Clock.maxon", whoseFile: "the runtime tier's own file, spelled with a leading `./`")
end 'a build naming a runtime file with a leading dot segment compiles that file once, as the tiers'
